example-platform-otaman/.otaman/
*.bak

# Per-repo configs generated by `otaman init` (kept in real projects, ignored in this example)
# After init: each repo gets CLAUDE.md, .mcp.json, .claude/, and .otaman (with agent: field)
*/.claude/
*/.mcp.json
*/CLAUDE.md
*/.otaman

